ic luxury banquet hall</div></div><div class="w-layout-grid fda-property-content-details-item"><div class="fda-font-weight-medium fda-color-primary">Vibe :</div><div>Estate Sophistication</div></div><div class="w-layout-grid fda-property-content-details-item"><div class="fda-font-weight-medium fda-color-primary">Year restored :</div><div>2022</div></div></div><div class="fda-property-line"></div><div appear="" class="w-layout-vflex fda-property-content-details-part"><div class="w-layout-grid fda-property-content-details-item"><div class="fda-font-weight-medium fda-color-primary">Atmosphere :</div><div>Warm &amp; Refined</div></div><div class="w-layout-grid fda-property-content-details-item"><div class="fda-font-weight-medium fda-color-primary">Capacity :</div><div class="w-layout-hflex fda-venue-details-guest"><div>Up to</div><div>500</div><div>Guests</div></div></div><div class="w-layout-grid fda-property-content-details-item"><div class="fda-font-weight-medium fda-color-primary">Accessibility :</div><div>Grand private hall entrance</div></div></div></div><div class="w-layout-vflex fda-property-details-feature-wrap"><div class="fda-property-details-feature-heading"><div text-appear="v1" class="fda-text-style-h3">Key Property Features</div></div><div appear="" class="fda-venue-details-richtext w-richtext"><p>Blending timeless architectural heritage with elevated modern comforts, this distinguished banquet venue is designed for elegant wedding celebrations and refined social gatherings. Rich oak detailing, handcrafted interiors, and carefully restored design elements create an atmosphere that feels both luxurious and inviting. The venueâ€™s spacious layout allows guests to move effortlessly between reception spaces while enjoying a sense of intimacy and classic sophistication throughout the celebration.</p><p>Every corner of the estate reflects exceptional craftsmanship, from polished timber finishes to softly illuminated gathering halls curated for unforgettable dining experiences and cinematic wedding moments. The property combines historic character with premium hospitality features, offering a seamless setting for ceremonies, receptions, and elevated evening celebrations filled with warmth, elegance, and timeless charm.</p><h5>Grand oak reception hall</h5><p>Architectural oak paneling, vaulted ceilings, and refined decorative accents create a stately reception environment designed to host luxurious celebrations with timeless ambiance, elegant seating arrangements, and unforgettable wedding experiences.</p><h5>Handcrafted heritage interiors</h5><p>Restored wood detailing and artisan-crafted finishes preserve the venueâ€™s historic character while introducing modern sophistication, creating beautifully balanced spaces filled with warmth, texture, and refined visual harmony throughout the estate.</p><h5>Ambient chandelier ballroom</h5><p>A signature ballroom illuminated by cascading chandeliers and soft architectural lighting offers an elevated atmosphere ideal for formal dining, live entertainment, and elegant evening receptions with graceful estate-inspired styling.</p></div></div><div class="w-layout-vflex fda-property-facilities-wrap"><div text-appear="v1" class="fda-text-style-h4">Amenities &amp; Facilities</div><div appear="" class="w-layout-hflex fda-veune-facilities-list-wrapper"><div class="w-layout-vflex fda-veune-facilities-list"><div class="w-layout-hflex fda-veune-facilities-list-item"><div class="w-layout-vflex fda-venue-details-icon"><img src="{{ asset('images/6a6305be5040b777232a149c_Venue-details-list-icon.svg') }}" loading="lazy" alt="Venue-details-list-icon"/></div><div>Luxury bridal preparation suite</div></div><div class="w-layout-hflex fda-veune-facilities-list-item"><div class="w-layout-vflex fda-venue-details-icon"><img src="{{ asset('images/6a6305be5040b777232a149c_Venue-details-list-icon.svg') }}" loading="lazy" alt="Venue-details-list-icon"/></div><div>Private fine-dining banquet area</div></div></di